{
  "file": "module5",
  "page": 57,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.21469116210938,
        527.2161254882812,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "Evidence:  In the SHINE trial, the primary efficacy outcome was a composite of treatment failure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4099731445312,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "(including an extension of treatment beyond the replacement of missed doses, TB treatment drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.386962890625,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "changes or restarts due to suspected treatment failure), on-treatment loss-to-follow-up, TB recurrence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.960428237915039,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.6025390625,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "or death by 72 weeks (from randomization), excluding children not reaching 16 weeks follow-up",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4113159179688,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "(modified-intention-to-treat). The non-inferiority margin for the primary efficacy outcome was 6%.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        495.0624694824219,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "The primary safety outcome was grade 3–5 adverse events recorded while on TB treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09461975097656,
        527.1043090820312,
        169.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "The SHINE trial definition of non-severe TB was: peripheral lymph node TB or respiratory TB (including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968955993652344,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.3143310546875,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "uncomplicated intrathoracic lymph node disease) confined to one lobe without cavities, no significant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980632781982422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        390.7915954589844,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "airway obstruction, uncomplicated pleural effusion, and no miliary TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.19850158691406,
        527.5457153320312,
        217.64149475097656
      ],
      "text": "The SHINE trial inclusion criteria were: children and young adolescents aged <16 years; weight ≥3 kg;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983086585998535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3986358642578,
        527.20068359375,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "no known drug resistance; symptomatic but non-severe TB; smear negative on gastric aspirate or other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.948429107666016,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.4176635742188,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "respiratory sample (an Xpert MTB/RIF positive, rifampicin susceptible result was allowed);  clinician’s  28",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.79859924316406,
        527.5609130859375,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "decision to treat with a standard first-line regimen; not treated for TB in the previous two years; known",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976825714111328,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        524.0941772460938,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "HIV status (positive or negative). Trial exclusion criteria were: respiratory sample acid fast bacilli smear-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976123809814453,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.4453735351562,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "positive (a smear-positive peripheral lymph node sample was allowed); premature birth (<37 weeks)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.3262939453125,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "and aged under 3 months; miliary TB, spinal TB, TBM, osteoarticular TB, abdominal TB, congenital TB;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980432510375977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.1123046875,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "pre-existing, non-tuberculous disease likely to prejudice the response to, or assessment of, treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995749473571777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.4234008789062,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "(such as liver or kidney disease, peripheral neuropathy or cavitation); any known contraindication to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.4268188476562,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "taking TB drugs; known contact with a drug-resistant adult source case (including mono-resistant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        384.708251953125,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "TB); known drug-resistance in the child; being severely ill; pregnancy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.9026184082031,
        527.249755859375,
        371.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "A total of 1204 children were enrolled in the trial between July 2016 and July 2018. The median age of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981134414672852,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.10260009765625,
        527.2216796875,
        384.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "enrolled children was 3.5 years (range: 2 months – 15 years), 52% were male, 11% had HIV-infection,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994548797607422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.3025207519531,
        527.427490234375,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "and 14% had bacteriologically confirmed TB. Retention in the trial by 72 weeks and adherence  to  29",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.5025939941406,
        527.2230834960938,
        410.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "allocated TB treatment were 95% and 94%, respectively. Sixteen (2.8%) versus 18 (3.1%) children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.7025146484375,
        527.1401977539062,
        424.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "reached the primary efficacy outcome (treatment failure) in the 16- versus 24-week arms respectively,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.982335090637207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.9026184082031,
        527.411376953125,
        437.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "with an unadjusted difference of -0.3% (95% CI: -2.3, 1.6). Treatment success was reported in 97.1%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.10260009765625,
        527.4299926757812,
        450.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "of participants receiving the 16-week regimen versus 96.9% in those receiving the 24-week regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.3025207519531,
        527.3969116210938,
        463.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "(relative risk (RR): 1.00, 95% CI: 0.98–1.02). Non-inferiority of the 16-week regimen was consistent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.5025939941406,
        527.4409790039062,
        476.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "across all intention-to-treat, per-protocol and key secondary analyses. This included restricting the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.7025146484375,
        527.4364624023438,
        490.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "analysis to the 958 (80%) children that were independently adjudicated to have TB at baseline by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.9026184082031,
        527.408935546875,
        503.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "the trial Endpoint Review Committee. A total of 7.8% of children experienced a grade 3–5 adverse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.10260009765625,
        527.4112548828125,
        516.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "event in the 16-week arm, versus 8.0% in the 24-week arm (RR: 0.98, 95% CI: 0.67–1.44). There were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.302490234375,
        527.402587890625,
        529.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "115 on-treatment grade ≥3 adverse events in 95 (8%) children, 47 (8%) in the 16-week and 48 (8%)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.5025634765625,
        524.3917236328125,
        542.945556640625
      ],
      "text": "in the 24-week arm, most common being pneumonia or other chest infections (29 (25%)) or liver-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.7025146484375,
        527.2396850585938,
        556.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "related events (11 (10%)) across both arms. There were 17 grade 3 or 4 adverse reactions (considered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981184005737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.902587890625,
        527.3909912109375,
        569.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "possibly, probably or definitely) related to trial drugs, including 11 hepatic events; all adverse reactions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973467826843262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1026000976562,
        341.56732177734375,
        582.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "except three occurred in the first eight weeks of treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.6305541992188,
        527.4307250976562,
        604.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "GDG considerations:  The GDG judged that while the desirable effects related to this PICO question",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        603.0064697265625,
        527.5941772460938,
        617.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "are related to treatment outcomes, shortening the duration of treatment is also important and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        616.20654296875,
        527.4588623046875,
        630.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "desirable (as reducing the length of treatment could make treatment easier for children and caregivers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966499328613281,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        629.406494140625,
        527.443359375,
        643.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "as well as reduce cost for families and the health system). The GDG discussed that since the SHINE",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        642.6065063476562,
        527.5458984375,
        657.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "trial was a non-inferiority trial, no difference in unfavourable outcomes between the two arms is what",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992648124694824,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        655.8065185546875,
        527.5526733398438,
        670.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "the trial aimed to detect. Therefore, both desirable and undesirable effects were judged by most GDG",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979331016540527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        669.0064697265625,
        527.4114379882812,
        683.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "members as trivial. Since non-inferiority of the 4-month regimen was demonstrated in the trial, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        682.20654296875,
        527.3893432617188,
        696.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "balance of effects was judged to not favour either the shorter or the longer duration of treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        718.2371215820312,
        526.6038818359375,
        731.9411010742188
      ],
      "text": "In the SHINE trial, children with Xpert MTB/RIF results had very low or low semi-quantitative results, or a negative result. Xpert Ultra  28",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86620330810547,
        731.037109375,
        188.24221801757812,
        741.5410766601562
      ],
      "text": "was not used in the SHINE trial.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        740.2718505859375,
        526.5991821289062,
        753.9757690429688
      ],
      "text": "In the SHINE trial, adherence was defined as the proportion of children who received an adequate amount of treatment (as defined in  29",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86620330810547,
        753.0718383789062,
        526.5582275390625,
        763.5758056640625
      ],
      "text": "the statistical analysis plan for both the intervention and control regimens; generally, a cut off of 80% of the allocated doses was used,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86620330810547,
        762.6718139648438,
        450.50811767578125,
        773.17578125
      ],
      "text": "within a certain time frame of starting each phase of treatment (i.e. intensive phase versus continuation phase).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        344.452392578125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "5. Treatment of TB disease in children and adolescents 33",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}